ur product doesn’t just exist, it actively works and evolves over time.","q2":"How does Base44 work?","a2":"Describe your idea in plain English, whether it's a general thought or a detailed requirement. Base44's AI interprets your instructions and generates the code, structure, design, and logic for your app or website. You can then refine and iterate by chatting with the AI until everything works the way you want.","q3":"How much does it cost to use Base44?","a3":"Base44 has a free tier so you can start building immediately without a credit card. The free plan includes monthly credits to generate and test your first apps and websites. Paid plans start at $16/month and unlock more credits, advanced features, and team capabilities. See current plans and what's included on the \u003ca href=\"/pricing\"\u003epricing page\u003c/a\u003e.","q4":"Do I need coding experience to use Base44?","a4":"No. Our platform is designed to be easily accessible to non-technical users. Just describe your software needs in plain language, and our AI will handle the technical implementation.","q5":"How do I build an AI app with Base44?","a5":"Building an AI app with Base44 is simple and feels really natural. Just describe your idea in plain language, and the \u003ca href=\"/ai-app-builder\"\u003eAI app builder\u003c/a\u003e will design and build a fully functional app for you. From there, you can easily iterate, test, and refine by chatting with the AI until your app does exactly what you need.","q6":"Can I create a website for free?","a6":"Yes, you can create a website for free with Base44's \u003ca href=\"/ai-website-builder\"\u003eAI website builder\u003c/a\u003e. The AI website builder lets you generate a complete website in minutes, including layout, content, and design, without coding or setup.\nYou can create different types of websites, such as business websites, landing pages, portfolios, online stores, and internal tools. Just describe what you want, and the AI website builder will generate a fully functional site tailored to your needs.","q7":"What types of applications can I build with Base44?","a7":"Base44 is versatile and can be used to build a wide range of applications, including but not limited to:\n\n• \u003ca href=\"/use-cases/categories/productivity\"\u003eInternal tools and productivity apps\u003c/a\u003e – Custom dashboards, task managers, or workflow automation tools.\n\n• \u003ca href=\"/use-cases/categories/dev-productivity\"\u003eDeveloper tools\u003c/a\u003e – Apps like internal dev dashboards or engineering workflow assistants.\n\n• \u003ca href=\"/use-cases/categories/business-intelligence-and-analytics\"\u003eCustomer portals and business apps\u003c/a\u003e – Client dashboards, CRMs, or reporting platforms.\n\n• \u003ca href=\"/use-cases/categories/education\"\u003eEducation and learning apps\u003c/a\u003e – Training portals, learning tools, or language-learning apps.\n\n• \u003ca href=\"/use-cases/categories/health-and-wellness\"\u003eHealth and wellness apps\u003c/a\u003e – Fitness trackers, habit builders, or wellness planners.\n\nYou can explore more ideas and ready-to-build examples in the \u003ca href=\"/use-cases\"\u003eBase44 Use Cases library\u003c/a\u003e.","q8":"What kind of integrations does Base44 support?","a8":"Base44 supports a wide range of integrations and connectors, so your apps and websites can connect to the tools you already use.\n\nYou can integrate with platforms like \u003ca href=\"/integrations/connectors/google-calendar\"\u003eGoogle Calendar\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"/integrations/connectors/gmail\"\u003eGmail\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"/integrations/connectors/slack\"\u003eSlack\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"/integrations/connectors/notion\"\u003eNotion\u003c/a\u003e, and CRMs such as \u003ca href=\"/integrations/connectors/hubspot\"\u003eHubSpot\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"/integrations/connectors/salesforce\"\u003eSalesforce\u003c/a\u003e to sync data, trigger workflows, and automate tasks.\n\nBase44 also supports custom integrations via APIs, allowing you to connect to almost any external service. In addition, many capabilities like sending emails, managing data, and generating content with AI are built in and available without extra setup.","q9":"How do credits work on Base44?","a9":"Credits power AI generation on Base44. Every time the AI builds, modifies, or refines your app or website, it uses credits. The free tier includes monthly credits to get you started, and paid plans include larger monthly allowances. Complex apps and longer iteration cycles use more credits, so we recommend planning your build in clear phases. You can check your remaining credits any time in your account dashboard. See \u003ca href=\"/pricing\"\u003epricing\u003c/a\u003e details for credit allowances per plan.","q10":"How are Base44 AI applications deployed?","a10":"We take care of it automatically. Base44 comes with built-in hosting, so there's no deployment process. When your app is created, it's instantly live and shareable.","q11":"What is a Superagent and how does it relate to my Base44 app?","a11":"A \u003ca href=\"/superagents\"\u003eSuperagent\u003c/a\u003e is a personal AI agent that takes action on your behalf. While your Base44 app is the product you're building, your Superagent is an autonomous assistant that can connect to your inbox, calendar, and tools to handle tasks for you. Superagents can also work alongside the apps you build on Base44, automating workflows and operating across your data so your product keeps moving even when you don't.","q12":"Is my data secure with Base44?","a12":"Yes, we take data security very seriously. User management and authentication systems are built-in, using best-in-class, industry-standard encryption and security practices to protect your data and your users' information.","q13":"Do I own the applications I create with Base44?","a13":"Definitely. All applications and content generated through Base44 belong en